%description:
Tests the keyword eor in the send script of TcpSessionApp (MSG_EOR). The client
is a TcpSessionApp with an MSS of 1000. It sends 1500 bytes that end a record,
and 1500 bytes more at t=1.0001 s. The first segment carries 1000 bytes. After
its ACK, the segment A004 carries the 500 bytes up to the record boundary at
1501, and no segment spans that boundary: the next segment starts at 1501.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 5s
*.cli_app.typename = "TcpSessionApp"
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1500 eor; 1.0001 1500"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 16384 
cli_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> FIN_WAIT_1  (on CLOSE)
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1001:1501(500) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.205 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1501:2501(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.205 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A F 2501:3001(500) ack 501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
sending data with 1500 bytes (eor)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
